  "contracts": [
    "ATYP1 maps raw four bytes to Ip(V4); ATYP4 maps raw sixteen bytes to Ip(V6); ATYP3 retains UTF8 as Domain even if text parses as IP.",
    "CONNECT prefix, empty domain, UTF8, unsupported ATYP, exact reads, port big endian, negotiation and forwarding errors unchanged.",
    "Local target requires enum Ip before existing loopback and exact-port checks; remote callers require Domain and exact names; H3 fallback requires literal IPv4 Ip.",
    "Session override controls now distinguish Domain(ORIGIN) from Ip(target_address), preserving actual forwarding/origin-name assertions.",
    "Mapped certificate consumer discards returned observation through existing stop; no String consumer remains there.",
    "Cancelled destruction observer send failure is intentionally ignored with let _; this changes no cancellation result or readiness oracle."
  ],
